# Draft: ntdll: Spawn main thread as a separate thread.
# https://gitlab.winehq.org/wine/wine/-/merge_requests/10058 state=closed
# This makes sure macOS main thread is a Wine thread as in https://gitlab.winehq.org/wine/wine/-/merge_requests/9579, while keeping its event loop usable for GUI, and makes every other platform work the same. Their main thread is parked for now, but the idea is to use the poll loop for various unix side internal purposes, such as winewayland pipe polling, compositing, etc. On macOS the main loop would be used similarly.
